  "rules": {
    "summon": "Retain a naturally obtained dune/seed/howler original source. Invest attack and survival HP in that source for original-source inheritance; goldob adjacent. Rattle source can lead to create real space. Keeper/incubator/pharaoh/matriarch compete for five actual positions; no inherited-child recursion assumption. Missing sources use combat bodies, no forced supply.",
    "frost": "Retain naturally obtained chaser/mage; train actual spell power there, not attack, stopping at current visible maximum enemy attack +2 chill dose; then support a second chill caster/scalable damage spell, leaving surplus unspent. Bench conduit when the selected primary meets the current threshold; low-power bench casters never keep it active. Conduit adjacent to core and another chill caster when available. Protect with durable front; retain a real attack payoff/body directly behind its taunt, and meet its visible-threat HP floor; do not fill the team with control-only bodies; drake/keeper/queen/wyvern are competing payoffs. Attack points support owned scout/drake/wyvern after comparing visible three-action cold-payoff estimates at one freeze opportunity; require >15%+2 improvement to transfer, so a new dragon does not automatically replace a mature scout/drake; legal sales refund the previous attack body training during this visible finisher transition and record lost permanent growth; current body is fallback; no source, no imaginary freeze combo.",
    "shared": "Only current visible shelf/offers and enemy threat; legal budgets, full history branches, no simulation selection. Shared SAP upgrade-offer buying/locking. No dependency on a unique general or six-tier.",
    "family": "summon"
  },
